        "2c920b74-e75b-4448-b0e0-f2ddb7e698bf": {
          "type": "rich-text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>All Patrick Adair Designs products are handmade, made to order. Our production timelines vary for each ring based on many things including but not limited to - material availability, labor availability, and order volume. Furthermore, <strong>our production timelines are merely estimates and are not guarantees</strong>. We will do our absolute best to get your order shipped within our current estimated timelines but by placing an order, you are acknowledging production delays may occur due to the things listed above. We will do our best to notify you if any delays do occur. If you have any questions regarding the status of your order or are needing your order sooner than the current estimated timeline (i.e. for a wedding), email us at support@patrickadairdesigns.com</p>",
            "align_text": "left"
          }
        },
        "e6ad0d02-2a01-41e5-9002-3fa3c4796bb2": {
          "type": "rich-text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Current Lead Times",
            "text": "<p>Below are our current lead times for all of our rings, grouped by ring type/material. Some rings are on a different lead time and will be listed separately. If you are unsure of what section your ring belongs to, refer to the \"Delivery\" section of the specific product listing.</p>",
            "align_text": "left"
          }
        },
        "template--14574611857490__312781d0-96bd-4627-abf9-f7ed33aed4b5-question-1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Glowstone Rings",
            "text": "<p>Glowstone rings are currently taking approx. <strong>1-2 weeks to ship </strong>from the date your order is received. If you select the \"Unsure - Send Ring Sizer First\" size option or purchase a Cremation Ring, these 1-2 weeks do not start until we receive your size/cremated remains from you.</p>"
          }
        },
        "9edaa1a8-e6fc-401d-be5e-7b9412d62dc0": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Gold Rings",
            "text": "<p>Most rings containing solid gold is currently taking approx <strong>4-6 weeks to ship.</strong></p>"
          }
        },
        "template--14574611857490__312781d0-96bd-4627-abf9-f7ed33aed4b5-question-2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
