        "e9488b45-be9e-41c3-afb4-b05cfa7c0070": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Pendants",
            "text": "<p>All pendants are handmade in batches with differing timelines based on material (excluding Glowstone pendants, which are made to order). Since they are made in batches, most pendants are in stock and ready to ship in 2-3 business days. Please refer to the Shipping Information Tab on the product page of each pendant to see specifics.</p>"
