        "question_8rpAUj": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Ring Sizers",
            "text": "<p>We send out our ring sizers through the mail via USPS, which doesn’t provide tracking information. Typically, you’ll receive your sizer 1-2 weeks from your order date. Once you receive the sizer in the mail, please email support@patrickadairdesigns.com with your size and we will move your order into our production queue.</p><p>If you do not receive your sizer 2 weeks after your order date, please contact us and we will get you a new sizer sent ASAP.</p>"
          }
        },
