          "type": "rich-text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Shipping Information and Rates",
            "text": "<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>United States Orders</strong></span></p><p>USPS First Class (3-5 business days once shipped): <strong>FREE</strong></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>International Orders</strong></span></p><p>All international orders are shipped through DHL Worldwide Express or UPS Worldwide Expedited. Rates are location based. You can estimate the cost of shipping by entering your mailing address in the checkout phase. </p><p>All orders with order value <strong>greater than $700 ship for FREE </strong>with DHL Worldwide Express.</p><p></p>",
